    "description": "Raw frame: the side of a laptop with several ports; the HDMI port is centered. 'What is this port used for?' must be grounded via lookup_manual. The frame is the only source of the port type — a query built from the words alone returns the wrong manual pages first. Passing your own image embedding (hybrid search) earns a bonus checkpoint."
